    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Reference:</strong> <em>Chronicles of Eberron</em> (p. 16–17), by Keith Baker (<a href=\"https://www.dmsguild.com/product/415474/Chronicles-of-Eberron\">DMs Guild</a>)</p><p><strong>Price:</strong> 25 gp; <strong>Bulk:</strong> L; <strong>Level:</strong> 2</p><p>An acoustic muffling attachment engineered by Cannith for the King's Dark Lanterns. Fitted over the prod and string of a crossbow, it reduces the release snap to an imperceptible whisper. Ranged Strikes made with the crossbow do not automatically reveal your position if you miss while hidden or undetected, and creatures take a -2 circumstance penalty to Perception checks to locate the shot's origin.</p>"
